Weasis rebuild (weasisrebuid)
================================

This tree reconstructs Weasis 4.7.3 as Weasis (Java, Apache Felix 7.0.5,
Swing, OSGi) from the specification in ZacharyTFerguson/dicomlight
docs/weasis-spec. It is an independent codebase, not a fork of
nroduit/Weasis.

Pin: Weasis 4.7.3. When weasis.org disagrees with tagged code, Have
follows the tagged code.

License: EPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0 (CHECKLIST §0 / ORIGIN.md).

No patient DICOM is stored in this repository.
